<p>Both return arrays (empty when nothing happened this frame). Related helpers: <code>Input.mouse_down</code>, <code>mouse_position</code>, <code>mouse_delta</code>, <code>mouse_world_position</code>, <code>viewport_size</code>, <code>ui_pointer_captured</code> (true when a HUD control owns the pointer), <code>text_entered</code>, <code>set_text_input_active</code>.</p>

<h2>Deterministic replay</h2>
<p>Replay fixtures record action frames and re-apply them through the authored context filter. Enabled recorded actions take precedence over physical bindings. The project fixed timestep must match the fixture.</p>
<pre><code>demi run \
  --input-replay fixtures/smoke.replay.json</code></pre>
